  "extract": "Salome, Op. 54, is an opera in one act by Richard Strauss. He adapted the libretto from Hedwig Lachmann's German translation of the 1891 French play Salomé by Oscar Wilde. Strauss dedicated the opera to his friend Sir Edgar Speyer.",
